    "rol": "Specialist Porsche · Valentin Motors",
    "bio": "More than 25 years of experience with collectible Porsche. He has supervised hundreds of special vehicle purchase and sale operations, with special focus on preparations.",
    "intro": "\"We have been looking for a RUF Kompressor R in similar condition to this one for many years. When we saw it, the decision was immediate.\"",
    "parrafos": [
      "The first thing that catches your attention about this car is not the paint, although the <strong>Irish Green</strong> on a polished concrete floor is almost unfairly beautiful. What is engaging is the coherence of the whole. Each element speaks the same language: the conversion RUF, the renewal of 2024 in Valentin Motors, the short lever, the green box with the red needles. Nothing is out of place.",
      "The <strong>RUF Kompressor</strong> system radically changes the 997’s personality without betraying its character. There is no turbo lag. Boost builds cleanly and progressively, and the 3,8-litre flat-six responds with a linearity few cars of this power can match. With its <strong>6-speed manual gearbox</strong> and <strong>all-wheel drive</strong>, the result is a Gran Turismo you can drive without restriction in any conditions.",
      "The record is impeccable. Three owners, original VIN Porsche, invoice RUF from 2011, complete documentation of the restoration from 2024. For a serious collector, that's as important as the car itself."
    ],
